  "body": "This issue was in Bugzilla then [issue 227 in the old repository](https://github.com/w3c/html/issues/227).\r\n\r\n[HTML 5.3](https://www.w3.org/TR/html53/iana.html#text-html) had clipboard formats for HTML.\r\n\r\nThe current living standard has wiped it off, maybe because it forked out of something else? \r\nUsing gibt blame shows the IANA lines from 2013 but the issue is from 2016...",
